## NOTE: secrets.yaml (+ .new / .draft / .bak variants) are ALLOWED
## to be tracked — but ONLY when sops-encrypted. The pre-commit hook's
## content-scan blocks any secret-named file lacking `ENC[AES...]` or
## `sops:` markers. Fix workflow: sops -e -i secrets.yaml → commit OK.
